ink-0 rounded-full size-1 " style="background-color:var(--color-success-dot)"></span>מחובר</span></div><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">מחובר לדף סטודיו דנה — לידים מגיעים אוטומטית.</p></div></div><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-solid font-medium text-white hover:bg-solid/85 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary disabled:opacity-60 mt-4">ניהול</button></article><article class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="shrink-0"><span class="flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#25D366]/15 ring-1 ring-white"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-3.5 bg-[#25D366] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/comment-dots.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/comment-dots.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink">הודעות מוכנות</h2><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] leading-tight " style="background-color:var(--color-success-bg);color:var(--color-success-text);border-color:var(--color-success-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1 " style="background-color:var(--color-success-dot)"></span>3 הודעות</span></div><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">1 מוכנות לשליחה · 1 בבדיקה</p></div></div><a href="/settings/integrations?section=templates" class="press flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-solid font-medium text-white hover:bg-solid/85 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ri